    =====================================================================
                    IMPORTANT THEORY - HINGLISH
    =====================================================================

    1. ROOT NODE:

       Sabse pehle mergeSort(0,6) call hota hai.
       Ye hamara ROOT node hai.

       Ye array ko LEFT aur RIGHT parts mein divide karta hai.


    2. LEFT RECURSIVE CALL:

       Root sabse pehle apne LEFT child ko call karta hai.

       Jab tak LEFT child complete nahi hota,
       root ki RIGHT call execute nahi hoti.

       Parent method wait karti hai.


    3. LEFT CHILD KA LEFT CHILD:

       Har node bhi same process follow karta hai.

       Pehle apne LEFT child ko call karta hai.
       Uske complete hone ke baad RIGHT child ko call karta hai.


    4. BASE CONDITION:

       Jab low >= high ho jata hai,
       iska matlab current part mein ek hi element hai.

       Isliye further division ki zarurat nahi hoti.

       Method return kar deta hai.


    5. RETURN FLOW:

       Jab child method return hota hai,
       control uske parent method mein wapas aata hai.

       Parent wahi se execution continue karta hai,
       jahan recursive call ke baad wali line hoti hai.


    6. RIGHT RECURSIVE CALL:

       Parent ki LEFT call complete hone ke baad
       parent apni RIGHT recursive call execute karta hai.

       Yaani har node pehle LEFT aur phir RIGHT execute karta hai.


    7. MERGE:

       Jab kisi node ke LEFT aur RIGHT dono child complete ho jaate hain,
       tab us node ka merge() method execute hota hai.

       Merge dono sorted parts ko compare karke
       ek sorted part banata hai.


    8. BACKTRACKING:

       Merge complete hone ke baad current node bhi complete ho jata hai.

       Ab control uske parent node mein return hota hai.

       Parent apni pending RIGHT call ya merge operation continue karta hai.


    9. BOTTOM-UP PROCESS:

       Pehle chhote single elements merge hote hain.

       Phir 2 elements ke sorted parts bante hain.

       Phir 4 elements ke sorted parts bante hain.

       Finally root ke LEFT aur RIGHT parts merge hote hain.

       Isi tarah complete array sorted ho jata hai.


